{"agent_id":"anon-8ea7a055","agent_seq":13,"timestamp":"2026-07-27T18:18:30.958499Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"eca996dc-d07a-4c56-b360-bb4a6d6af889","comment_uuid":"22b2cb22-deef-48e5-889b-239414cf2507","author":"anon-8ea7a055","content":"Plan: bundle branch fix/4-45-dashboard-v3-and-finalize-guard from develop@6f1bb0ed (verified unchanged upstream; gh#4 and gh#45 both OPEN, unclaimed, no competing PRs). Two parallel investigations mapping (a) the dashboard v2-coupling inventory and v3 state-read patterns, (b) HubMeta genesis persistence + watermark-bounded reduce design for the finalize guard. Implementation follows the maps; CI-lint parity gate before each commit; one commit per fix; push gate then single PR to develop.","created_at":"2026-07-27T18:18:30.958477Z","kind":"plan"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-8ea7a055","agent_seq":14,"timestamp":"2026-07-27T18:24:53.948572Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"eca996dc-d07a-4c56-b360-bb4a6d6af889","comment_uuid":"2efcc9d0-cd29-4992-b7a3-0c0fc85ea3f8","author":"anon-8ea7a055","content":"gh#45 design (investigation complete): (1) HubMeta gains genesis_checkpoint_commit + seed_agent_tips (BTreeMap agent->sha), both serde-default optional - populated in seed_v3_refs at migrate_hub_v3.rs:1072 from the SHAs commit_blob_to_ref/:1062 and commit_log_bytes/:1047 already return and discard; (2) new RefHubSource::at_tips pinned constructor (hub_source.rs:464 pattern, pure field init); (3) finalize replaces verify_against_files call at :1479 with verify_finalize: v2-frozen check vs the PERSISTED genesis (parse state.json @ genesis_checkpoint_commit), seed-intact via merge-base --is-ancestor per recorded ref (ancestry not byte-prefix - survives REQ-11 prune), bounded AC-6 reduce at the pinned seed tips. Aggravating finding: dispatcher fetch_v3 -> refresh_local_checkpoint rewrites CHECKPOINT_REF pre-verification (cache.rs:525), so the defect fires single-machine. Pre-fix hubs (None fields): old full check as fallback, refuse with remigrate-from-v2 guidance if it fails. Six tests incl. gh#45 regression, prune survival, tamper refusal, pre-fix fallback. Phase A verify at :649 unchanged.","created_at":"2026-07-27T18:24:53.948555Z","kind":"decision"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-8ea7a055","agent_seq":15,"timestamp":"2026-07-27T18:26:55.571897Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"eca996dc-d07a-4c56-b360-bb4a6d6af889","comment_uuid":"ebc6cdb2-a776-492b-9c86-2253275f92a0","author":"anon-8ea7a055","content":"gh#4 dashboard map (investigation complete): reader is ALREADY mode-routed (reader.rs:148 -> read_snapshot_v3 reads CHECKPOINT_REF:state.json; tested). Real breakage + minimal fixes: (1) poll.rs:308 fetch refspec crosslink/hub errors every tick on v3 - change to glob +refs/heads/crosslink/*:refs/heads/crosslink/* (pattern at hub_v3_operation_tests.rs:196) + gate ensure_hub_cache_worktree on !is_v3 resolved AFTER fetch; (2) reader.rs:140 hub_sha/last_commit_at v2-keyed even on v3 path - derive from checkpoint tip in the v3 branch; (3) github_api.rs:174 discovery 404-fallback probe crosslink%2Fcheckpoint; (4) projects.rs:537 track check -> detect_hub_version + refs/remotes/origin probes (LOCAL only - gh#34 network caution), warn only on Absent; (5) actions.rs:222 reset --hard skipped when v3; (6) server sync.rs:67 hub_branch string from sm.hub_mode(); (7) trust.rs read_signature_state: v3 verifies CHECKPOINT_REF tip via existing verify_commit_signature. OUT OF SCOPE (noted for upstream): ci_status/agent_requests v3 parity (reader.rs:206-251 gaps), unreachable_project alert never fires (poll never sets status=error - pre-existing v2 gap too). Test fixtures: local bare remotes per watcher.rs:294 setup_watcher_env + hub_v3_operation_tests clone_for_agent; v3 twins for poll/projects/actions fixtures; NO network URLs (gh#34 still unfixed).","created_at":"2026-07-27T18:26:55.571876Z","kind":"decision"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-8ea7a055","agent_seq":16,"timestamp":"2026-07-27T20:17:36.574161Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"eca996dc-d07a-4c56-b360-bb4a6d6af889","comment_uuid":"084e1987-2e21-4108-aa4d-bb83f56d3010","author":"anon-8ea7a055","content":"Both fixes implemented and committed on fix/4-45-dashboard-v3-and-finalize-guard: 57404fa1 (gh#45 - HubMeta genesis persistence, RefHubSource::at_tips, verify_finalize with v2-frozen/ancestry/bounded-reduce checks + pre-metadata fallback, 5 tests) and b19f05ab (gh#4 - seven dashboard sites: glob fetch refspec + worktree gate, checkpoint-keyed freshness, action reset gate, discovery checkpoint probe, track v3 markers, sync-status ref name, checkpoint-tip signature verification, 3 tests, all local-bare fixtures). Targeted suites green (migrate 29, dashboard 130, projects 36, sync handlers 8, trust 19, hub_source 15, watcher 14); CI-exact clippy + fmt clean. Full bin suite running; PR body staged. Awaiting full-suite verdict then operator push.","created_at":"2026-07-27T20:17:36.574136Z","kind":"result"}}
