{"agent_id":"anon-8ea7a055","agent_seq":39,"timestamp":"2026-07-29T01:52:48.567339Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"75e9caf2-3e8c-4b2f-ad97-6c9f018c5b92","comment_uuid":"7ee73e51-d060-44c9-8f42-7c8569123c38","author":"anon-8ea7a055","content":"Filed gh#48 (unreachable_project alert never fires - nothing sets projects.status=error) and gh#49 (v3 reader returns ci_status/agent_requests empty). gh#34 fix implemented on fix/34-dashboard-advisory-network-hang @ 59462745: env-scoped the poll fetch + track-time remote-show (GIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT=0, neutralized GIT_ASKPASS, -c credential.helper=) so a headless dashboard serve never hangs on a credential prompt; made detect_default_branch fixtures hermetic via a recorded local remote HEAD. 2 regression tests; dashboard suites green (27 projects, 5 poll); CI-exact clippy + fmt clean. Full bin suite running, then push gate + PR to develop.","created_at":"2026-07-29T01:52:48.567316Z","kind":"result"}}
