{"agent_id":"anon-8ea7a055","agent_seq":60,"timestamp":"2026-07-29T06:03:11.809525Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"029afced-8d1a-4506-80de-17783effd8fd","comment_uuid":"88c29c2c-4efb-47e1-9411-d331a814983b","author":"anon-8ea7a055","content":"Scope decided after reading merged-develop code. Bundle (branch fix/48-49-53-dashboard-v3-monitoring): (1) gh#48 - poll_project captures fetch/read outcome and writes projects.status='error' (unreachable: read_snapshot Err = clone gone, or fetch-failed-with-no-hub_sha) vs 'active'; the unreachable_project alert keys on project.status=='error' (alerts.rs:89) which the poll never set. (2) gh#49 agent_requests HALF - new v3 aggregator over agent refs (requests-out/requests-ack blobs paired by ulid), wired into read_snapshot_v3 (currently hardcoded Vec::new). (3) gh#53 - server sync-status last_fetch_at derives from cache-dir mtime, stale on v3; branch on hub_mode, use FETCH_HEAD/checkpoint-ref mtime. SPLIT OUT: gh#49 ci_status half - v2 read meta/ci-status.json from the worktree; v3 has no such file AND no v3 CI-status writer exists, so porting the reader reads nothing - needs a v3 home + writer (design), its own follow-up. Also filed gh#53 this session; closed local #15 (gh#34 merged).","created_at":"2026-07-29T06:03:11.809507Z","kind":"plan"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-8ea7a055","agent_seq":61,"timestamp":"2026-07-29T06:51:32.806505Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"029afced-8d1a-4506-80de-17783effd8fd","comment_uuid":"d172cde5-501c-4dde-8e30-5d2c7d6be1ed","author":"anon-8ea7a055","content":"PR opened: dollspace-gay/crosslink#54 (fix/48-49-53-dashboard-v3-monitoring, base develop). Fixes gh#48 + gh#53; addresses gh#49 agent-requests half (ci_status half split, no v3 writer yet). 3 commits (3d5e87f5 gh#48, f619d43d gh#49, 607303e5 gh#53). Full suite 2853/0 (second clean run); clippy+fmt clean. Also filed gh#53 this session. Awaiting dollspace review/merge.","created_at":"2026-07-29T06:51:32.806481Z","kind":"result"}}
