{"agent_id":"anon-8ea7a055","agent_seq":94,"timestamp":"2026-08-01T21:04:15.958114Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"b21ba76e-f322-49ec-9e97-db230081a651","comment_uuid":"c6208bcf-122a-45f8-8325-99976fcf6204","author":"anon-8ea7a055","content":"Both fixed on fix/9-10-container-toolchain-auth: d40526d3 (gh#10: entrypoint parses /host-auth/*.env line-by-line, allowlist CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN/ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, value verbatim after first '=', quotes/CR stripped, export-prefix accepted, never executed/echoed; env-file resolution only on actual hit; VERIFIED with adversarial fixture - injection payload does not execute, was executing+truncating before) + 39fc021f (gh#9: build-essential added to image apt layer; rustup had no cc/linker counterpart). clippy/fmt/container tests green; full gate running. PR body staged (Fixes #9. Fixes #10.). Epic #2 body updated: #9/#10/#19 folded in (container dispatch section + flow-integrity), #55 triage results recorded, watch list trimmed to #18/#27/#28.","created_at":"2026-08-01T21:04:15.958084Z","kind":"result"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-8ea7a055","agent_seq":95,"timestamp":"2026-08-01T21:10:41.972005Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"b21ba76e-f322-49ec-9e97-db230081a651","comment_uuid":"e01130d7-fd36-4940-a5d0-62c4215c012f","author":"anon-8ea7a055","content":"Changelog-conflict preemption: both branches inserted at the same anchor (top of ### Fixed) = guaranteed conflict for whichever merges second (the PR#50/#51 collision pattern). Since neither branch is pushed yet, amended fix/9-10 tip (39fc021f -> 0fbd11b6) to move its two entries to the TAIL of ### Fixed; #59 keeps the top. Hunks now ~140 lines apart with disjoint context. PROVEN clean: diff3 -m (59-version, base 6b4f736f, 910-version) merges with zero conflicts, all three entries present - either merge order works. PR body updated (new SHA + placement note). Process note for the epic's next branches: concurrent unmerged branches must target disjoint changelog anchors; durable fix would be upstream changelog.d fragments or merge=union gitattribute - propose to dollspace if collisions keep hurting.","created_at":"2026-08-01T21:10:41.971982Z","kind":"decision"}}
