{"agent_id":"anon-8ea7a055","agent_seq":101,"timestamp":"2026-08-01T21:49:24.385639Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"69abdd99-b5f1-44d6-a6ac-10af0b18cb6f","comment_uuid":"0146fb93-85e4-4335-9d80-fccd58151ad6","author":"anon-8ea7a055","content":"All five implemented on fix/56-57-58-60-19-kickoff-flow-integrity, one commit each: 2cf4fbd4 gh#19 (dry-run guards moved before worktree/PlanRecord creation; would-be names printed; run still creates the tracker issue for the prompt id), d6ee70c3 gh#60 (exit-124 trailer writes TIMEOUT sentinel on both launch paths + normalize_status maps it to timed-out), a4d80b40 gh#57 (H2 Phase/Layer sections parse into RequirementGroups; no false positive on 'Phased Rollout'), a977e8a2 gh#56 (design.md skill: create-if-absent + jq in-place doc_hash update, history preserved), 06ac4a67 gh#58 (agent_overrides + hook defaults tightened to the documented contract: merge/rebase/cherry-pick/reset/stash/tag/patch/branch-surgery blocked, commit gated; plain push kept for the CI-verify draft-PR flow and prompt+guides reworded to say so accurately). Verification: kickoff 184 / design_doc 47 / init 154 green, py_compile clean, clippy CI-exact + fmt clean. Changelog mid-section anchor; diff3 pairwise CLEAN vs both PR#63 and PR#64 branches. Full-suite gate running; PR body staged.","created_at":"2026-08-01T21:49:24.385621Z","kind":"result"}}
