{"agent_id":"anon-8ea7a055","agent_seq":125,"timestamp":"2026-08-02T01:35:43.173691Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"c2b216b7-fd04-4392-b5d8-77fb497b10b9","comment_uuid":"ae58dd02-146e-4b0c-971c-6b5a814a138f","author":"anon-8ea7a055","content":"PR#65 CONFLICT diagnosed. merge-tree preview (develop a85c92e2 x #65, base 6b4f736f): ONLY 2 real conflicts - launch.rs + src/commands/kickoff/tests.rs. run.rs and CHANGELOG.md AUTO-MERGE clean. Root: #63 (gh#59) refactored build_agent_command to use the shared permission_flag() helper + added skip_flag to launch_container's container command; #65 (gh#60) added the exit-124 TIMEOUT trailer to BOTH build_agent_command and the container command. Merged form must carry BOTH: develop's permission_flag() call + #65's TIMEOUT trailer, in build_agent_command AND launch_container. tests.rs: reconcile #63's appended test_permission_flag_postures with #65's TIMEOUT assertion updates + appended test_normalize_status_timeout_sentinel. MY MISS: I diff3-verified only CHANGELOG for cross-branch safety, not the shared SOURCE files (#63/#65 both touch launch.rs/run.rs/tests.rs) - lesson: when concurrent branches touch the same source, merge-tree-preview source conflicts too, not just changelog. RESOLUTION PLAN: operator runs 'git merge upstream/develop' in the #65 worktree; I resolve launch.rs+tests.rs (both changes retained); build+full gate; operator commits+pushes. #63/#64 closeout DONE: binary a85c92e2 installed, fleet 5/5, 2 merged worktrees removed.","created_at":"2026-08-02T01:35:43.173675Z","kind":"decision"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-8ea7a055","agent_seq":126,"timestamp":"2026-08-02T01:51:37.870284Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"c2b216b7-fd04-4392-b5d8-77fb497b10b9","comment_uuid":"0cde4d44-7511-4c2f-8435-8e4574799be6","author":"anon-8ea7a055","content":"PR#65 conflict RESOLVED. 3 files reconciled off upstream/develop merge: (1) launch.rs - build_agent_command AUTO-MERGED correctly (permission_flag() from #63 + TIMEOUT trailer from #65, non-overlapping regions); launch_container was the real conflict, resolved to carry BOTH skip_flag + TIMEOUT trailer. (2) kickoff/tests.rs - both appended tests kept (test_normalize_status_timeout_sentinel #65 + test_permission_flag_postures #63). (3) CHANGELOG.md - CAUGHT AN AUTO-MERGE CORRUPTION: git silently dropped the gh#53 entry's opening line (dangling '(gh#53).'), restored it; full Fixed section audited, all entries present once, no other mangling. knowledge/ markers confirmed string-literals (conflict-parser code), not artifacts. Build clean, clippy+fmt clean, 3 merged-code tests green. Full gate running. LESSON REINFORCED: auto-merge on adjacent CHANGELOG insertions can produce clean-but-WRONG results - always read the merged section, not just check for markers.","created_at":"2026-08-02T01:51:37.870261Z","kind":"resolution"}}
