{"agent_id":"anon-8ea7a055","agent_seq":140,"timestamp":"2026-08-02T03:30:30.270188Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"57601a9d-fc95-44f0-9d97-e607e810a749","comment_uuid":"c6fefa82-b69c-4ee9-a4d7-ebf89f45ae33","author":"anon-8ea7a055","content":"PR#65 MERGED (a153c3d2) - the ENTIRE vsdd kickoff bundle is now in develop. Merged set: #63(gh#59), #64(gh#9/#10), #72(gh#66), #65(gh#19/56/57/58/60). Closeout: develop synced to a153c3d2; last bundle worktree (kickoff-defect-cluster) removed; binary rebuilding eba9a1cd->a153c3d2 (rollback crosslink-0.9.0-eba9a1cd preserved). EPIC magnificentlycursed/crosslink#2 STATUS: every defect + capability-blocker item merged; #55 pending final live-fire retest with rebuilt agent image (all its container+plan contributors now landed: #31/#59/#9/#10/#66); only forward work = #61/#62 which now has a design doc (.design/dispatch-dials-and-injection-seam.md). gh# issues close on dollspace's next develop->main sync.","created_at":"2026-08-02T03:30:30.270163Z","kind":"result"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-8ea7a055","agent_seq":141,"timestamp":"2026-08-02T03:35:50.533217Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"57601a9d-fc95-44f0-9d97-e607e810a749","comment_uuid":"7df195db-65fe-4e53-9592-723574f565cb","author":"anon-8ea7a055","content":"Bundle closeout DONE: global binary a153c3d2 installed (rollback crosslink-0.9.0-eba9a1cd + earlier tags preserved); crosslink 5/5 + mdatron 5/5 integrity; all bundle worktrees removed (only develop + caches remain). FLAGGED (separate, NOT crosslink/not this session's work): vsdd-cli integrity dropped 5/5 -> 3/5 - counters FAIL (checkpoint next_comment_id 1398, expected >=1401) + hydration FAIL (858 reduced vs 859 sqlite, 1 sqlite-only issue). Looks like a live desync from vsdd-cli's active dev (xqjG). NOT touching vsdd-cli data - surfaced to operator for decision (could be in-flight write; a repair could clobber concurrent work).","created_at":"2026-08-02T03:35:50.533199Z","kind":"result"}}
