{"agent_id":"anon-8ea7a055","agent_seq":150,"timestamp":"2026-08-02T04:06:12.614197Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"68bca661-5338-4ab4-8406-48851cec28aa","comment_uuid":"ed848292-5574-4319-ba4c-39160c16601f","author":"anon-8ea7a055","content":"#55 CONTAINER PATH VERIFIED = WORKS. Faithful no-TTY test (forecast-bio agent image, entrypoint handles auth/PATH/gosu, docker run WITHOUT -t, claude --dangerously-skip-permissions in an untrusted /workspaces/repo whose container claude config was fresh): claude PROCEEDED, output CONTAINERHI, LAUNCHEXIT=0, NO trust dialog. ROOT DISTINCTION: the trust-dialog stall is TTY-dependent. tmux path gives claude an interactive PTY -> the folder-trust dialog RENDERS -> headless park (STILL BROKEN, #55 tmux/plan half). container path = docker run -d, NO PTY -> claude runs non-interactively -> the interactive trust dialog cannot render -> --dangerously-skip-permissions proceeds -> WORKS. So #59's container fix + no-TTY = container dispatch is fine. #55 is now precisely: the TMUX/plan path only. IMPLICATION for the fix: headless dispatch's robust vehicle is --container (works today); the tmux fix is either (a) run claude non-interactively/-p in the tmux path so it behaves like the container (no PTY dialog), (b) trust pre-grant (Option A), or (c) route headless plan through a container. NOTE: 'crosslink container build' (merged image) FAILED - separate issue, docker-desktop swallowed the error; DEFAULT_AGENT_IMAGE ghcr.io/dollspace-gay/crosslink-agent:latest is unpublished (forecast-bio#576). Used the local forecast-bio image for this test.","created_at":"2026-08-02T04:06:12.614179Z","kind":"result"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-8ea7a055","agent_seq":151,"timestamp":"2026-08-02T04:11:22.949254Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"68bca661-5338-4ab4-8406-48851cec28aa","comment_uuid":"13a0bde7-d824-4342-a18a-02fd0e2da683","author":"anon-8ea7a055","content":"Posted refined #55 report to dollspace (issuecomment-5155201419): stall is TTY-specific, container path verified WORKING, tmux/plan path is the remaining stall, recommended fix = non-interactive/--container mode for headless kickoff plan (fallback: trust pre-grant; refuted: strip settings). #55 now awaits dollspace's direction on the fix. OUTSTANDING (non-blocking): (1) ~/.claude.json sandbox trust entries from the tmux test need operator cleanup - classifier blocked me (one-liner provided earlier). (2) 'crosslink container build' merged-image build FAILED - separate defect worth its own investigation (possible #64 build-essential regression or transient; docker-desktop swallowed the error). (3) DEFAULT_AGENT_IMAGE ghcr.io/dollspace-gay/crosslink-agent:latest unpublished (forecast-bio#576).","created_at":"2026-08-02T04:11:22.949239Z","kind":"result"}}
