{"agent_id":"anon-8ea7a055","agent_seq":155,"timestamp":"2026-08-02T04:22:26.252316Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"5fb134c5-be01-43c0-944a-8580dd3ec4c7","comment_uuid":"0c48f971-4510-4b65-8cbd-9c717e6c1983","author":"anon-8ea7a055","content":"#2 BUILD FAILURE ROOT-CAUSED (confirmed via manual docker build): 'crosslink container build' fails at COPY step - Dockerfile line 47 'COPY crosslink-${TARGETARCH} /usr/local/bin/crosslink' but container.rs:254 stages the binary as plain 'crosslink' (no arch suffix) -> '/crosslink-amd64: not found'. Name mismatch: just build-image stages crosslink-${DOCKER_ARCH} (matches), crosslink container build stages 'crosslink' (mismatch) -> the container-build command is broken for ALL platforms. Bonus: it also copies current_exe() (host binary; darwin on macOS) instead of cross-compiling a linux binary, so even fixed-name it'd need a linux target. Real upstream defect.","created_at":"2026-08-02T04:22:26.251843Z","kind":"result"}}
{"agent_id":"anon-8ea7a055","agent_seq":156,"timestamp":"2026-08-02T04:25:01.214981Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"5fb134c5-be01-43c0-944a-8580dd3ec4c7","comment_uuid":"8496c480-1cde-48c4-ac4a-931a4c156c80","author":"anon-8ea7a055","content":"STATUS on the 5 items: (1) ~/.claude.json cleaned (removed sandbox trust entry, projects back to 9). (2) container-build failure root-caused = COPY name mismatch (container.rs stages 'crosslink', Dockerfile wants 'crosslink-${TARGETARCH}') + copies host binary. (3) FILED upstream dollspace#75 (build bug + unpublished image). PUBLISH-OUR-OWN feasible: fork's .github/workflows/container-image.yml publishes to GHCR on push-to-develop and stages the binary CORRECTLY (musl per-arch, crosslink-<arch>) - but IMAGE_NAME is hardcoded 'dollspace-gay/crosslink-agent'; needs repo-owner-derived (${{github.repository_owner}}/crosslink-agent) + Actions enabled on the fork to publish ghcr.io/magnificentlycursed/crosslink-agent. That's a 1-line workflow change on develop (diverges the mirror slightly; also upstreamable). (5) FORK MIRROR BEHIND: origin/develop d77a37ba (need a153c3d2), origin/main 85691369 (need 26ee1885); local both current. Pushes are operator's: git push origin develop + git push origin main.","created_at":"2026-08-02T04:25:01.214957Z","kind":"result"}}
